[05/12 11:24:26    763s]                         # clock gates is disabled, including clock gates which may have been cloned by
[05/12 11:24:26    763s]                         # CTS.
[05/12 11:24:26    763s]                         # Note that this attribute has no impact on 'ccopt_design -cts'. See also attribute
[05/12 11:24:26    763s] cts_merge_clock_gates.
[05/12 11:24:26    763s] 
