[05/12 11:24:26    763s]                         # A list of routing layer. LEF OBS shapes on each <layer> that are overlapped partially by a shape on TRIMMETAL layer that trims the routing layer, will be extended in the preferred
[05/12 11:24:26    763s]                         # routing direction to be fully covered by the trim shape. This is a workaround for some advanced node libraries to avoid trim/OBS short violations.
[05/12 11:24:26    763s]   read_physical_extend_polygon_cell_shapes(root)
[05/12 11:24:26    763s]                         # string, read/write, default={}, indices={}
[05/12 11:24:26    763s]                         # A list of {{<layer> <value>} ...} pairs. LEF PIN/OBS shapes on each <layer> that are polygons (not simple rects), will be extended with OBS SPACING 0 rects by <value> (in microns) in
[05/12 11:24:26    763s]                         # the preferred routing direction. This is a workaround for some advanced node libraries to avoid spacing violations during routing.
