[05/12 11:24:26    763s]                         # to both the static and dynamic components of the delay arc. When set to '0', the AOCV derate will only apply to the static component of the delay.
[05/12 11:24:26    763s]   timing_derate_aocv_reference_point(root)
[05/12 11:24:26    763s]                         # int, read/write, default=1, indices={}
