[05/12 11:24:26    763s]                         # will overwrite an existing directory of the same name. A %s in the string is replaced with the design name (e.g. it will overwrite the directory for the same design but not for a
[05/12 11:24:26    763s]                         # different design). A %d in the string is replaced with a unique integer to avoid overwriting any existing directory.
